{
    "title": "BFF Test - Friendship Test",
    "description": "Welcome to True BFF - BFF Test , a game that brings you a new kind of excitement and joy into the relationship with your best friend. You can also play this delightful game with your partner or your family members.\r\n\r\nTurn boring times into something fun and exciting with this friendship quiz game and have unlimited fun with your friends anytime, anywhere !\r\n\r\nIf you have ever wondered who among your friends or family members knows you the best, and want to find out in a delightful way, then download our game for free and find out! Our quiz game is here to put the question of \u201chow well my best friend knows me?\u201d to the ultimate test. It\u2019s an interactive and fun way to find out how well your friends or loved ones understand your personality, your quirks, and your preferences among other things.\r\n\r\nThis game is perfect for one-to-one time pass or social gatherings like parties or a casual evening. This game will surely bring surprises, laughter, and maybe a bit of friendly competition. Imagine a party gone dull, and you introduce this game and everyone gets excited and the party comes back to life! Such is the power of this simple but extremely fun and interesting personality quiz game. Anyone can come up with their own questions, and share to others to answer them. Different people giving different answers will make it even more interesting.\r\n\r\nHOW THIS FUN FRIENDSHIP TEST GAME WORKS:\r\n\r\nTrue BFF is a really simple game but allows you to have a lot of fun. Here\u2019s how to play this game:\r\n\r\n** Create Your Quiz:\r\nCreating quiz is really easy in this game. Just answer 10 questions about yourself, which can range from your favorite hobbies, celebrities, foods, or your most cherished memories and more. \r\n\r\n** Share With your Friends:\r\nOnce the quiz is created, the app will generate a link to share with your friends via Snapchat, Instagram or messaging platform. Once your friends get the link with the questions, they can give their answers based on their knowledge about you and send it back to you.\r\n\r\n** See Their Answers:\r\nUpon getting the answers from your friends, you can read them and see who knows you the best. You can also play it when hanging out together. Once everyone gives their answers, all of you can have a fun time together by reading the answers and enjoy every moment of it. I\u2019m sure it will cause some genuinely delightful moments full of joy and laughter.\r\n\r\nWHY PLAY THIS GAME:\r\n** Have Fun:\r\nOne of the prime reasons we have friends is to have fun with them, and this game can be a great way to do that.\r\n\r\n** Learn More About Your Friends and Yourself:\r\nThis game allows you and your friends to have a beautiful opportunity to discover new things about each other. Even when you are creating a quiz, you might discover something new about yourself, not to mention, you can correct your friend\u2019s misconceptions about you and vice versa.\r\n\r\n** For Couples Too:\r\nIf you are looking for a couple\u2019s game to have fun or know each other better, this game can be a great way to do that. Knowing your partner better can strengthen your relationship, and this game is here to help in a delightful way. \r\n\r\nDownload our friendship quiz game today and embark on a journey of laughter, discovery, and connection. Challenge your friends and uncover who truly knows you best. It\u2019s time to create, share, and enjoy endless fun.",
